{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghae2jYtHGPWNMFaGXM7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The AI-only match runs to completion with no exceptions, and points resolve through the expected reasons. Before going further I'll write a progress file in the dev folder, so the state survives any context compaction."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3331,"cache_read_input_tokens":281595,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3331},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68c96722-ff85-4e7d-8e61-8c2d4dde53f4","uuid":"2258160e-37ed-4204-8be8-4a80d35757b7","timestamp":"2026-11-04T08:34:50.303Z","request_id":"req_011Cghae2PDGe4s6tb9QHsEj"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghae2jYtHGPWNMFaGXM7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Nz3ZZfgQmguqxWbSFD1m1g","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > README-DEV.md <<'EOF'\n# Ahead or Alive: Xtreme Beach Volleyball: dev notes (model: claude-haiku-5-5, medium effort)\n\nFolder: this is `DEV/` (the TASK.md subfolder). The deliverable is one level up:\n`../AheadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-DeadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-012424.html`.\n\n## Commands\n- `node tools/build.mjs`: builds `build/game.js`, `build/dev.html` and the deliverable.\n- `node tools/smoke.mjs [file] [png]`: opens the deliverable in headless Chromium, screenshot, console errors.\n- `node test/run.mjs`: the test command (prints only failures and one count line).\n\n## Layout\n- `src/*.js`: the game, concatenated in name order inside one IIFE (`const E = My3D2dge, G = {}`).\n- `engine/my-3d2dge.js`: the engine (handoff v0.85.2) with three patches, marked `AOA:`:\n  1. Button symbols default to PlayStation (Input.glyphs and the Settings option; Xbox A B X Y is the option).\n  2. Dialog: a function `voice` gets every newly shown letter (the Animalese hook).\n  (Patch \"touch off\" is done in game code: `game.input.touchEnabled = false`.)\n- `vendor/aihub-session.js`, `hub/*`: AI Hub client and harness (unmodified). Never bundled into test code.\n- `.src/`: sparse clone of the engine repository (reference only).\n\n## Module map (src)\n00 core, 01 tuning (G.T sliders), 02 cast data, 03 items data, 10 input maps + glyphs + prompts,\n11 UI kit (List, Grid, focus, toasts), 13 rigs, 14 court (TileMap beach, backdrop, net), 20 ball (closed-form launch),\n21 Match class and referee (planner, touch, point), 22 players and judge, 23 AI, 24 match loop (phases, net, landing,\nblocks), 26 match scene (draw, HUD, prompts), 50 title (temporary), 99 main (boot, scenes).\n\n## Status\n- Done: boot, title (temporary), engine smoke test, closed-form ball, referee, planner, human judge, AI, serve, blocks,\n  court, rigs, HUD, prompts. AI-only headless match runs to completion (`.tmp/sim.mjs`).\n- Not yet: vacation (calendar, map, locations, talk, gifts, shops, saves), Pool Hop, casino, photo mode, album, story,\n  audio (music, sfx, voices), exhibition setup, attract mode, dev panel, About/Credits/How to Play, hub session, tests.\n\n## Deviations from the plan (to be reported in the final reply)\n- Swimsuit cut and pattern: the engine's Humanoid is used as shipped (no athletic build patch, no swim outfit patch);\n  suits are drawn as outfit colors (top = main, shorts = accent, lines = trim). No mocap clip set is cut.\n- Hair styles are mapped onto the engine's five styles.\nEOF\necho saved","description":"Write the dev-notes progress file"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3331,"cache_read_input_tokens":281595,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3331},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68c96722-ff85-4e7d-8e61-8c2d4dde53f4","uuid":"30a59ae3-4b69-4f73-b813-42371eb97b88","timestamp":"2026-11-04T08:34:56.270Z","request_id":"req_011Cghae2PDGe4s6tb9QHsEj","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Nz3ZZfgQmguqxWbSFD1m1g":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-012424__x8def6b/work/AheadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-DeadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-012424 && cat > README-DEV.md <<'EOF'\n# Ahead or Alive: Xtreme Beach Volleyball: dev notes (model: claude-haiku-5-5, medium effort)\n\nFolder: this is `DEV/` (the TASK.md subfolder). The deliverable is one level up:\n`../AheadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-DeadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-012424.html`.\n\n## Commands\n- `node tools/build.mjs`: builds `build/game.js`, `build/dev.html` and the deliverable.\n- `node tools/smoke.mjs [file] [png]`: opens the deliverable in headless Chromium, screenshot, console errors.\n- `node test/run.mjs`: the test command (prints only failures and one count line).\n\n## Layout\n- `src/*.js`: the game, concatenated in name order inside one IIFE (`const E = My3D2dge, G = {}`).\n- `engine/my-3d2dge.js`: the engine (handoff v0.85.2) with three patches, marked `AOA:`:\n  1. Button symbols default to PlayStation (Input.glyphs and the Settings option; Xbox A B X Y is the option).\n  2. Dialog: a function `voice` gets every newly shown letter (the Animalese hook).\n  (Patch \"touch off\" is done in game code: `game.input.touchEnabled = false`.)\n- `vendor/aihub-session.js`, `hub/*`: AI Hub client and harness (unmodified). Never bundled into test code.\n- `.src/`: sparse clone of the engine repository (reference only).\n\n## Module map (src)\n00 core, 01 tuning (G.T sliders), 02 cast data, 03 items data, 10 input maps + glyphs + prompts,\n11 UI kit (List, Grid, focus, toasts), 13 rigs, 14 court (TileMap beach, backdrop, net), 20 ball (closed-form launch),\n21 Match class and referee (planner, touch, point), 22 players and judge, 23 AI, 24 match loop (phases, net, landing,\nblocks), 26 match scene (draw, HUD, prompts), 50 title (temporary), 99 main (boot, scenes).\n\n## Status\n- Done: boot, title (temporary), engine smoke test, closed-form ball, referee, planner, human judge, AI, serve, blocks,\n  court, rigs, HUD, prompts. AI-only headless match runs to completion (`.tmp/sim.mjs`).\n- Not yet: vacation (calendar, map, locations, talk, gifts, shops, saves), Pool Hop, casino, photo mode, album, story,\n  audio (music, sfx, voices), exhibition setup, attract mode, dev panel, About/Credits/How to Play, hub session, tests.\n\n## Deviations from the plan (to be reported in the final reply)\n- Swimsuit cut and pattern: the engine's Humanoid is used as shipped (no athletic build patch, no swim outfit patch);\n  suits are drawn as outfit colors (top = main, shorts = accent, lines = trim). No mocap clip set is cut.\n- Hair styles are mapped onto the engine's five styles.\nEOF\necho saved","description":"Write the dev-notes progress file"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01Nz3ZZfgQmguqxWbSFD1m1g":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-012424__x8def6b/work/AheadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-DeadOrAliveXtremeBeachVolleyball-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-012424"}}}
