{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghd7S9SjTKpdfFz8Qqh3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The IK change passes the suites. Next is the plan's claim-and-validate scheme for online play. The host publishes the planned contact for each seat. A client judges its own press against the hub clock and sends a claim. The host accepts a claim only if it falls in the contact's window, the claimant is in reach, and the touch is still open. Dives and calls still go to the host as presses."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3944,"cache_read_input_tokens":637840,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3944},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68c96722-ff85-4e7d-8e61-8c2d4dde53f4","uuid":"f1ee1c39-20a6-460e-b842-9c1103004a77","timestamp":"2026-11-04T09:07:21.059Z","request_id":"req_011Cghd7RieiKtxJEfww66Qv"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghd7S9SjTKpdfFz8Qqh3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ENd1mgpCYCN8sSsouGNfq1","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > .tmp-cl.mjs <<'EOF'\nimport fs from 'node:fs';\nconst edit = (f, a, b) => { let s = fs.readFileSync(f, 'utf8'); if (s.split(a).length !== 2) throw new Error(f + ' :: ' + a.slice(0, 80)); s = s.replace(a, () => b); fs.writeFileSync(f, s); };\nconst F = 'src/25-netplay.js';\n// the host publishes the planned contact of each seat in its snapshot\nedit(F, \"ll: M.L ? M.L.id : 0, tc: M.callText ? M.callText.text : '' }, { reliable: false });\",\n\"ll: M.L ? M.L.id : 0, tc: M.callText ? M.callText.text : '', pd: M.pending && !M.pending.judged ? { seat: M.pending.p.seat, ts: M.pending.ts, kind: M.pending.kind, P: M.pending.P.slice(0, 2) } : null }, { reliable: false });\");\n// the host takes claims: a touch from a client, judged by the client, is accepted if it is valid\nedit(F, \"    if (d.t === 'i') { const I = H.remote[from]; if (I) { for (const a of d.a || []) I.pend.add(a); if (d.m) I.mv = d.m; } }\",\n\"    if (d.t === 'c') G.hubClaim(from, d);\\n    if (d.t === 'i') { const I = H.remote[from]; if (I) { for (const a of d.a || []) if (a === 'dive' || a === 'call') I.pend.add(a); if (d.m) I.mv = d.m; } }\");\nedit(F, \"  if (d.tc) M.callText = { text: d.tc, t: .8 };\", \"  if (d.tc) M.callText = { text: d.tc, t: .8 };\\n  H.plan = d.pd || null;\");\n// the client judges its own press on the hub clock and sends the claim\nedit(F, \"  const acts = ['play', 'shot', 'dive', 'call'].filter(a => I.pressed(a));\\n  if (acts.length) AIHub.send({ t: 'i', a: acts, m: I.move() }, { reliable: true });\",\n\"  const acts = ['dive', 'call'].filter(a => I.pressed(a));\\n  if (acts.length) AIHub.send({ t: 'i', a: acts, m: I.move() }, { reliable: true });\\n  for (const a of ['play', 'shot']) if (I.pressed(a)) G.hubClaimFor(a);\");\nedit(F, \"G.hubClientUpdate = function (dt) {\", `/* a client's touch claim: judged here on the hub clock against the planned contact the host published */\nG.hubClaimFor = function (action) {\n  const H = G.hub, pl = H.plan, me = H.info && H.info.me;\n  if (!pl || pl.seat !== me) return;\n  const at = AIHub.time() / 1000, err = at - pl.ts;\n  if (err < -.6 || err > G.T.okWin * 1.2 + .05) return;\n  const assist = (G.DIFFICULTY[G.settingsOpts().difficulty] || { assist: 1 }).assist;\n  const ae = Math.abs(err), q = ae <= G.T.perfectWin * assist ? 'perfect' : ae <= G.T.greatWin * assist ? 'great' : ae <= G.T.okWin * assist ? 'ok' : 'miss';\n  if (q === 'miss') return;\n  AIHub.send({ t: 'c', at, k: pl.kind, q, a: action, aim: G.aimPoint ? G.aimPoint() : [0, 0] }, { reliable: true });\n};\n/* the host's validation of a claim: the touch is still open, it is the seat's planned kind, the time is in the window\n * (the planned window with 120 ms for the network), the claimant is in reach of the contact; then the host plays it */\nG.hubClaim = function (from, d) {\n  const H = G.hub, M = H.M; if (!M || H.role !== 'host') return;\n  const pd = M.pending; if (!pd || pd.judged || pd.p.seat !== from || pd.kind !== d.k) return;\n  if (Math.abs(d.at - pd.ts) > G.T.okWin * 1.2 + .12 + .05) return;\n  const P = pd.P, reach = Math.hypot(P[0] - pd.p.x, P[1] - pd.p.y);\n  if (reach > G.T.reach + .4 * pd.p.stat('TEC') + 12) return;\n  const q = ['perfect', 'great', 'ok'].includes(d.q) ? d.q : 'ok';\n  pd.judged = true;\n  M.resolveTouch(pd.p, pd, q, d.a === 'shot' ? 'shot' : 'play');\n  H.claims = (H.claims || 0) + 1;\n};\nG.hubClientUpdate = function (dt) {`);\nconsole.log('ok');\nEOF\nnode .tmp-cl.mjs && rm .tmp-cl.mjs && grep -n \"aimPoint\" src/25-netplay.js | head -2; node tools/build.mjs | tail -1","description":"Add client touch claims and the host's validation of them"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_token